<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse halts trade in Thai Petro.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse halts trade in Thai Petro.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand halted trading in the shares of Thai Petrochemical Industry Plc before the morning session began on Friday.</p>
<p>The exchange said the company had yet to disclose some information to the market which could affect its stock price.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
</text>
